# Normalize line endings to LF regardless of local core.autocrlf.
# Apps Script (clasp) and GitHub Actions expect LF; keeps diffs clean on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gs   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
